  refine GlobalTheory.T.zetaIntegral_model_of_cover _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ (h1.1 t al be ga de hd) ?_ hM hN.ord.1 hm hC fun Φ hΦ => ((hJ Φ).1 hΦ).symm
